## Summary
Bomb threat emails were sent to approximately 40 courts across South Korea. The threats are presumed to be false and are believed to have originated from Japan.

## Key Points
- Bomb threat emails targeted about 40 courts nationwide in South Korea.
- The threats are considered to be false or hoaxes.
- The origin of the threats is presumed to be from Japan.


